@startuml ATTEMPTS
' Resubmission: a stuck attempt is replaced by one of higher priority. The
' constrain says what a replacement is; the assume note says what no guard
' can - that the replacements stop - and csdflivelockfree takes it as a
' hypothesis of the livelock-freedom theorem once the attempts are hidden.
state "稼働中" as running {
  running : attempts ; AttemptId ⇸ Attempt

  state "attempts : (試行ID : AttemptId) ⇸ Attempt" as runningAttempts <<promote>> {
    !include local/ATTEMPT.puml
  }
}

[*] --> running

note bottom of runningAttempts
  constrain RESUBMIT?試行ID?再投入ジョブ ; $再投入ジョブ の置換元 は〈滞留〉にあり、$再投入ジョブ の優先度 > 置換元 の優先度
end note

note as fair
  assume 優先度を上げた置換を続ければ、いつかいずれかの試行が〈完了〉になる
end note
@enduml
